    "body": "An example for powershell:\r\n```powershell\r\nSet-PSReadLineOption -ContinuationPrompt \"`e[1;33m❯`e[0m \"\r\n```\r\n\r\nFor Bash (Probably works the same for Zsh):\r\n```bash\r\nPS2=$\"\\e[1;33m❯\\e[0m \"\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is a static string of course. It's something you might want to come from `starship` e.g. `starship prompt --continuation`.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
