    "body": "@segevfiner Thanks for the tip!\r\n\r\nWhen I remove the line that sets `[System.Console]::OutputEncoding` the unicode arrow is changed to an ascii question mark of the same color. This problem still occurs if I call `Set-PSReadLineOption` outside of the prompt function.\r\n\r\nSetting `[System.Console]::InputEncoding` seems to have no effect, so I think the output of `starship prompt --continuation` is interpreted incorrectly by `Set-PSReadLineOption`. I'm going to play around with the script some more and see what I can do without setting this global variable.",
